{"id":"300365f146cacc8a","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-presheaf-category.md","title":"Definition — Presheaf and Presheaf Category","display":"Definition — Presheaf and Presheaf Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-presheaf-category","aliases":["14-df-presheaf-category"],"display":"Definition — Presheaf and Presheaf Category","depends_on":["[[14-df-small-category]]","[[14-df-functor]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-presheaf-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-presheaf-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Presheaf and Presheaf Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"898681611f432286\" href=\"?note=898681611f432286\" title=\"14-df-small-category\">14-df-small-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴。反范畴和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>；函子范畴的完整六元组见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C^{\\mathsf{op}},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}),\\\\\n\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FunCat}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathsf{op}},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C^{\\mathsf{op}},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}),\\\\\n\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FunCat}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathsf{op}},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：I.1 The Categories at Issue，印刷页 24–28。预层范畴的对象为预层，箭头是有源/靶的自然变换，恒等与复合逐分量计算。这些现在属于形式定义，不再只藏于 Remark。它是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>-小、局部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小的范畴。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286"